                                                "sense_id": "a3762838-2735-3cb7-bc90-6814b7e7e188",
                                                "text": "Ailourophobia†, (Katiphobia, or Gatophobia,) is a typical monomania. The fear of cats in certain monopsychoneurotic and psychopathic persons dates back to the beginning of the life of the feline."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e65482ff-8a41-43b2-91c9-23cfd5b8316f",
                                                "sense_id": "a3762838-2735-3cb7-bc90-6814b7e7e188",
                                                "text": "Whatever the cause there are many recorded instances of persons suffering from ailurophobia exhibiting symptoms of distress in rooms which apparently contained no cats; later cats would be discovered, hidden behind curtains or in closets."
                                            }
